f3c9ecb5.mp3", "buttery|Do you want to meet today or tomorrow?": "dec199cbcc60.mp3", "airy|Yes, I do.": "f3ba21cedc19.mp3", "airy|Tomorrow works better for me.": "1bd12623df27.mp3", "airy|At the meeting.": "6d055568baf6.mp3", "buttery|Whose laptop is this?": "57bbc4154d40.mp3", "airy|It's on the table.": "2b0c1b53892a.mp3", "airy|A new model.": "1c98e58f4920.mp3", "airy|I think it's Mr. Kim's.": "fc5de6f4768a.mp3", "buttery|The elevator is out of order, isn't it?": "e5524fca16f6.mp3", "airy|Yes, we have to use the stairs.": "ebf9a9866558.mp3", "airy|I ordered it yesterday.": "23b6df7f98eb.mp3", "airy|On the fifth floor.": "13cf532344a6.mp3", "buttery|How much does the annual membership cost?": "bc8a453a1ddd.mp3", "airy|Once a year.": "82e360346098.mp3", "airy|Sixty dollars.": "c8f4dd6b498f.mp3", "airy|At the front desk.": "74eb6466e479.mp3", "buttery|Why don't we take a short break?": "125e8a1949ec.mp3", "airy|Because it's broken.": "08a6ceb2c866.mp3", "airy|It took an hour.": "b69063463fc6.mp3", "airy|That's a good idea.": "d003a9e802ad.mp3", "buttery|Which bus goes to the city center?": "c88e412b743c.mp3", "airy|Number twelve.": "262f965f7c7d.mp3", "airy|Every ten minutes.": "00bdb9ce5397.mp3", "airy|It's very crowded.": "9be28ceb5e05.mp3", "buttery|When is the deadline for the budget report?": "1962584b7ffc.mp3", "airy|In the finance office.": "b903ddd97f1d.mp3", "airy|The end of this month.": "a677d1d62074.mp3", "airy|Mr. Chen wrote it.": "cafc8b4733b2.mp3", "buttery|Can you help me move these boxes?": "6f2af2a4c571.mp3", "airy|A moving company.": "e5dea881f8cf.mp3", "airy|They're cardboard.": "e2ea3e14983e.mp3", "airy|Sure, where should I put them?": "85cbb0d97d74.mp3", "buttery|Who should I contact about the invoice?": "d50565d19ec5.mp3", "airy|Try the accounting department.": "43954b63da04.mp3", "airy|By e-mail.": "7ba49cd195d8.mp3", "airy|It's fifty dollars.": "0937696bd47a.mp3", "buttery|Didn't you attend the workshop last week?": "9d40c6fa62fd.mp3", "airy|It lasts two hours.": "4c98087b581b.mp3", "airy|No, I was on a business trip.": "fafcea4efdd5.mp3", "airy|The shop is closed.": "f60d626f4361.mp3", "buttery|How often do you back up your files?": "28dd5a4a3581.mp3", "airy|On the back shelf.": "e344233d200c.mp3", "airy|A large folder.": "c7a68e3e6834.mp3", "airy|At least once a week.": "58bd4a901c2f.mp3", "buttery|Where can I find the visitor parking area?": "82615ff7035d.mp3", "airy|It's behind the main building.": "77e93fec15f2.mp3", "airy|For two hours.": "4814f6819910.mp3", "airy|I parked there yesterday.": "674c2721e45d.mp3", "buttery|Would you mind closing the window?": "b90ebcd5efdb.mp3", "airy|A closing sale.": "a15f2550fded.mp3", "airy|Not at all.": "d03821a70d53.mp3", "airy|Near the door.": "44fd6f426ea5.mp3", "buttery|What time does the pharmacy open?": "5b08dfe1fe1b.mp3", "airy|On Main Street.": "6002c0c068c8.mp3", "airy|Some medicine.": "fb8919d3c782.mp3", "airy|At nine A.M.": "76ae7c7fe70b.mp3", "buttery|I can't find my employee badge.": "a985d06b3b12.mp3", "airy|Have you checked your desk drawer?": "ff34d8e4d72b.mp3", "airy|It's a nice badge.": "de40155e86c9.mp3", "airy|Yes, I found one.": "ded29a18e681.mp3", "buttery|Should I book a hotel room for the conference?": "d72b0a01f2a7.mp3", "airy|A double room.": "a814cfc9c610.mp3", "airy|Yes, please reserve one for two nights.": "b9bf8b66eaef.mp3", "airy|The book is on the shelf.": "96e35a98da18.mp3", "buttery|How was your presentation this morning?": "90ead881b9fc.mp3", "airy|At ten o'clock.": "29ec9d9dfa53.mp3", "airy|In the main hall.": "59c2bbe98192.mp3", "airy|It went really well, thanks.": "aa990718b7d1.mp3", "airy|Hi, Mark. Have you finished the sales report for the Singapore office?": "6ef56af8b32a.mp3", "rounded|Almost. I'm still waiting for the figures from the accounting department.": "2923195a2864.mp3", "airy|The meeting is at three o'clock. Could you call them and ask them to hurry?": "7710db16d1f0.mp3", "rounded|Sure, I'll call them right now.": "d8c5964b30da.mp3", "airy|Excuse me, I bought this blender here last week, but it stopped working yesterday.": "39cd1b19e2bd.mp3", "rounded|I'm sorry to hear that. Do you have your receipt?": "2c742c84a80a.mp3", "airy|Yes, here it is. Could I exchange it for a new one?": "dcf71f775095.mp3", "rounded|Of course. Let me get one from the stockroom.": "dde51c553c0b.mp3", "rounded|Hi, I'd like to reserve a table for six people this Friday at seven.": "79b71763c21a.mp3", "airy|I'm sorry, we're fully booked at seven. We have a table at eight thirty.": "a752430acd60.mp3", "rounded|That's a little late, but it's fine. It's for my colleague's retirement party.": "3a9733536479.mp3", "airy|Great. May I have your name, please?": "e15cc546986a.mp3", "airy|Tom, the projector in room three isn't working, and my presentation starts in twenty minutes.": "752ad0b2729a.mp3", "rounded|Have you tried restarting it?": "225c9ec64429.mp3", "airy|Twice. It still shows a blank screen.": "b6d9a8c2998d.mp3", "rounded|Then use room five instead. I'll let the attendees know about the change.": "e0cfc61897dd.mp3", "rounded|Good morning. I have an appointment with Doctor Patel at ten.": "5b70b60f67a6.mp3", "airy|Good morning. Could you fill out this form while you wait? The doctor is running about fifteen minutes late.": "e67e1a4c2777.mp3", "rounded|No problem. Is there a place where I can get some water?": "9d1ada44bbf5.mp3", "airy|There's a water cooler just around the corner.": "ef890a41c5da.mp3", "airy|Did you hear that the company is opening a new branch in Osaka?": "a55b2c0d2cf6.mp3", "rounded|Yes, I heard they need a manager for it. Are you going to apply?": "a958341bc361.mp3", "airy|I'm thinking about it. The application deadline is next Friday.": "10d67cee1fbd.mp3", "rounded|You should. You have more experience than anyone on the team.": "ee257fa4544a.mp3", "rounded|Hello, I'm calling about the apartment listed on your website. Is it still available?": "5f7baeea84c3.mp3", "airy|Yes, it is. It has two bedrooms, and it's a five-minute walk from the subway.": "398b0397789e.mp3", "rounded|Sounds perfect. Could I see it this weekend?": "3f3f89141fab.mp3", "airy|Sure. How about Saturday at eleven?": "4be6faded9ed.mp3", "airy|Kevin, the client wants the brochures by Wednesday instead of Friday.": "9a01668a4008.mp3", "rounded|That's tight. The printing company needs at least three days.": "6890c2bbad16.mp3", "airy|Could we pay extra for express service?": "7c08f2f5412e.mp3", "rounded|Let me call them and check the price.": "b299fc2083f8.mp3", "rounded|I'd like to send this package to Toronto. How long will it take?": "b12e04df96e5.mp3", "airy|Standard delivery takes seven days. Express takes two, but it costs twenty dollars more.": "e7c26a29ba90.mp3", "rounded|I'll take express. It's a birthday gift, and it needs to arrive by Friday.": "1c643dcd64c2.mp3", "airy|All right. Please write the address on this label.": "8476257ad3a4.mp3", "airy|The new accounting software is confusing. I can't figure out how to create an invoice.": "89e4db08ffaf.mp3", "rounded|There's a training session tomorrow at two in the computer lab.": "f537320d7638.mp3", "airy|Oh, good. Do I need to sign up?": "b370db2273f6.mp3", "rounded|Yes, just send an e-mail to the IT department.": "8fd8151cc499.mp3", "rounded|Welcome to Sunrise Hotel. How may I help you?": "3b0d5b62071f.mp3", "airy|I have a reservation under the name Garcia, for three nights.": "29c939328e95.mp3", "rounded|Yes, Ms. Garcia. Your room is ready. Breakfast is served from six to ten on the second floor.": "c7c72d16cc4e.mp3", "airy|Thank you. Could I also get a wake-up call at six thirty?": "338630741f6d.mp3", "airy|Our team exceeded the sales target by fifteen percent this quarter.": "9ab05638bd9f.mp3", "rounded|That's great news. We should celebrate. How about a team lunch on Friday?": "6682f504affe.mp3", "airy|Good idea. I'll reserve the Italian place across the street.": "ddcf6635c5ad.mp3", "rounded|Perfect. I'll send an invitation to everyone this afternoon.": "c13be188d1fc.mp3", "rounded|Excuse me, does this train stop at Central Station?": "d1da4fb0d3da.mp3", "airy|No, this is the express. You need the local train on platform four.": "032cd39bad93.mp3", "rounded|Oh, thanks. When does it leave?": "7bbbeb7a99c2.mp3", "airy|In about five minutes, so you'd better hurry.": "9ad7257a2c09.mp3", "buttery|Attention, passengers. Flight 372 to Osaka has been delayed due to bad weather.": "e2c9d115512a.mp3", "buttery|The new departure time is 4:45 P.M. Passengers are asked to remain near gate 12.": "9a9ab3386053.mp3", "buttery|Meal vouchers are available at the service counter next to the gate.": "a5f1ce84e02d.mp3", "buttery|We apologize for the inconvenience.": "cdd297d8e234.mp3", "buttery|Hello, this is Sarah from Bright Dental Clinic calling for Mr. Howard.": "1cf51f9c7c38.mp3", "buttery|I'm calling to remind you of your appointment tomorrow at 2 P.M. Please arrive ten minutes early to update your insurance information.": "e35b28eef45c.mp3", "buttery|If you need to reschedule, call us at 555-0178 before 5 P.M. today.": "e8ab40aadcf4.mp3", "buttery|Thank you.": "2fb35a443a4e.mp3", "buttery|Attention, shoppers. Welcome to Greenfield Supermarket. Today only, all fresh fruit and vegetables are twenty percent off.": "134073145ea1.mp3", "buttery|Also, don't forget to visit our new bakery section near the entrance, where you can try free samples of our bread.": "518de60959a7.mp3", "buttery|The store will close at 10 P.M. tonight. Thank you for shopping with us.": "cbbacdd4a876.mp3", "buttery|Good morning. This is the seven o'clock weather report. Heavy rain is expected throughout the afternoon, with strong winds in coastal areas.": "0f31f147ba78.mp3", "buttery|Drivers should allow extra time for the evening commute. The rain will clear by tomorrow morning, and the weekend looks sunny and warm.": "bfea1525352d.mp3", "buttery|Stay tuned for the traffic update, coming up next.": "5deddf51818f.mp3", "buttery|Welcome to the Harborview Museum. My name is Linda, and I'll be your guide today.": "8a2927910b7d.mp3", "buttery|The tour will last about one hour. We'll start in the modern art gallery and finish in the sculpture garden.": "4c037f2f57c3.mp3", "buttery|Please remember that photography is not allowed inside the galleries.": "feabe576394e.mp3", "buttery|After the tour, you're welcome to visit the gift shop on the first floor.": "47dd83db9a68.mp3", "buttery|Thanks for coming, everyone. Before we begin, I have an announcement.": "876a49abc89c.mp3", "buttery|Starting next Monday, the office will switch to a new security system.": "2edc992a886e.mp3", "buttery|Each employee will receive a new I.D. card, which you'll need to enter the building.": "8ee9489dd97f.mp3", "buttery|Please pick up your card from the security desk by Friday. If you lose it, there will be a ten-dollar replacement fee.": "651b9330cef6.mp3", "buttery|Are you looking for a place to stay fit? Join Peak Fitness Center this month and get your first month free.": "beced52912ed.mp3", "buttery|We offer modern equipment, yoga classes, and personal trainers.": "9e8d03ff86ef.mp3", "buttery|We're open twenty-four hours a day, seven days a week. Visit our website or stop by our location on Lake Street to sign up today.": "c2e7586eb171.mp3", "buttery|Thank you for calling City Electric. Our offices are currently closed.": "25361952f32b.mp3", "buttery|Our business hours are Monday through Friday, 8 A.M. to 6 P.M. To report a power outage, press one.": "c0469ef13af8.mp3", "buttery|To hear your account balance, press two. For all other questions, please call back during business hours.": "a0088fb42867.mp3", "buttery|Attention, passengers on the 9:15 train to Riverside. Due to track maintenance, this train will depart from platform six instead of platform two.": "f3050dee14d5.mp3", "buttery|The departure time has not changed. Passengers with large luggage should use the elevator at the north end of the station.": "9a89d85e015f.mp3", "buttery|We thank you for your patience.": "50dc1fbc1599.mp3", "buttery|Good evening, and welcome to the annual employee awards dinner.": "d96174706c14.mp3", "buttery|Tonight, we're honoring Maria Santos, who has worked in our customer service department for twenty years.": "44d0287aeaed.mp3", "buttery|Maria has trained more than one hundred new employees and has always been a role model for her team.": "029bad4f28b7.mp3", "buttery|Please join me in welcoming Maria to the stage.": "148f7ded8e67.mp3", "buttery|Where should I put these files?": "706eaa81c0ab.mp3", "airy|On the shelf next to the printer.": "87dc3b732b65.mp3", "airy|Yes, I filed them.": "8f9e6d6c8cbc.mp3", "airy|By tomorrow afternoon.": "62be99c0de9c.mp3", "buttery|When does the training session begin?": "5838481fcd55.mp3", "airy|In Room 4.": "5e2a95dca6cb.mp3", "airy|At ten thirty.": "a549f5258879.mp3", "airy|Ms. Chen is leading it.": "085752faf408.mp3", "buttery|Who's going to pick up the clients from the airport?": "7312cc28a169.mp3", "airy|Flight 205.": "490d50eca76b.mp3", "airy|I think Daniel is.": "24f79b35a76b.mp3", "airy|At the arrivals gate.": "b18662a005bf.mp3", "buttery|Why is the parking lot closed today?": "4f83a8e9a7ce.mp3", "airy|They're repaving it.": "e3b31bf7b94a.mp3", "airy|Near the main entrance.": "afe1e8fbc423.mp3", "airy|Yes, it's open now.": "4440e40f981e.mp3", "buttery|How did the interview go?": "d4aacb7e1f54.mp3", "airy|Next Tuesday.": "283b3770d6e0.mp3", "airy|Very well, I think.": "19bf670fafb5.mp3", "airy|On the second floor.": "9e7447a7759e.mp3", "buttery|Would you like me to print the agenda?": "4e8594413a9f.mp3", "airy|Yes, that would be helpful.": "4edfdaac747a.mp3", "airy|The printer on the left.": "895836e00dea.mp3", "airy|An agenda for the meeting.": "769c127bff59.mp3", "buttery|Isn't the store open on Sundays?": "a4d21dd44bd1.mp3", "airy|No, only Monday through Saturday.": "f8b346eba184.mp3", "airy|I bought it at the store.": "f9077db69518.mp3", "airy|It was a great opening.": "451bb12172a9.mp3", "buttery|Which supplier did you choose?": "0ba17d6e46b2.mp3", "airy|The one with the lowest price.": "687f41b8d46b.mp3", "airy|Some office supplies.": "1a22808f1db7.mp3", "airy|Yes, I chose it.": "eda3fbd41a59.mp3", "buttery|Have you finished the budget proposal?": "57919f8e97bf.mp3", "airy|I'm still working on it.": "d42f89efa1eb.mp3", "airy|A proposal letter.": "3b8ec634f31a.mp3", "airy|The budget is large.": "202f233b3a46.mp3", "buttery|Can you show me how to use the new scanner?": "b8248a3f298d.mp3", "airy|Sure, it's quite simple.": "a9262028b720.mp3", "airy|It's a new scanner.": "bbb440481f30.mp3", "airy|I saw the show yesterday.": "2182ab5b7364.mp3", "buttery|How many people are attending the dinner?": "efc345c5c502.mp3", "airy|About fifty.": "6a8566a4af8f.mp3", "airy|At the Italian restaurant.": "7323b5cc2985.mp3", "airy|Yes, they are.": "7b1557b2e043.mp3", "buttery|Should we take a taxi or the subway?": "dcafa674e713.mp3", "airy|The subway is faster at this hour.": "a6abe1c1865c.mp3", "airy|Yes, we should.": "46771fc785be.mp3", "airy|It's a long way from here.": "d8de4970db25.mp3", "buttery|Where's the nearest post office?": "995c48dcc099.mp3", "airy|Two blocks down this street.": "bc0455e19447.mp3", "airy|I'll post it later.": "8668f9b2ea77.mp3", "airy|Before five o'clock.": "c2e6c861b7c1.mp3", "buttery|The heater in the conference room isn't working.": "1cb8c4e449ad.mp3", "airy|I'll call maintenance.": "731a7855e5de.mp3", "airy|It's a large room.": "b459fb53a777.mp3", "airy|The meeting is at noon.": "f41184307f23.mp3", "buttery|What time does the last train leave?": "d5de2efffc84.mp3", "airy|From platform three.": "24241e8c7e1f.mp3", "airy|At eleven fifteen.": "e38e1790439c.mp3", "airy|A round-trip ticket.": "e487e97bd1fb.mp3", "buttery|Why don't you take the afternoon off?": "6b9abc30f92e.mp3", "airy|Thanks, I think I will.": "e6b4bc17b901.mp3", "airy|Because it's raining.": "029031d994b8.mp3", "airy|It's off the main road.": "3ebc8f8e2e96.mp3", "buttery|Who approved the new design?": "3ab7a498e5ef.mp3", "airy|The marketing director did.": "2d5c78e59df3.mp3", "airy|It looks very modern.": "a3cc67fc2496.mp3", "airy|Yes, it was approved.": "1e95ef3d92c1.mp3", "buttery|Did you receive my e-mail about the schedule?": "73ef432f57be.mp3", "airy|Yes, I read it this morning.": "f9b333e16468.mp3", "airy|A new schedule.": "63941a56c7b7.mp3", "airy|I'll send it by mail.": "431e35e60eb4.mp3", "buttery|How long have you worked here?": "3834dc8207cd.mp3", "airy|For about six years.": "867e091a4d6e.mp3", "airy|It's a long hallway.": "1545d0ea5726.mp3", "airy|Every weekday.": "875c20e841e6.mp3", "buttery|Would you mind waiting a few minutes?": "1d4afe958053.mp3", "airy|A minute ago.": "33fd33daf998.mp3", "airy|I don't mind the store.": "73e132ca84e2.mp3", "buttery|When will the new software be installed?": "d2a3b84408f8.mp3", "airy|Over the weekend.": "b3e8ca45b134.mp3", "airy|The IT team will do it.": "7e7676416ceb.mp3", "airy|It's very useful.": "7beecbb41fbe.mp3", "buttery|Where did you put the client's contract?": "3dd7a86eae1a.mp3", "airy|It's in the top drawer.": "4fcf2b495503.mp3", "airy|He signed it yesterday.": "96cf58f9ebc7.mp3", "airy|Yes, I put it there.": "31a629f34641.mp3", "buttery|Aren't you coming to the team lunch?": "97457c197b65.mp3", "airy|I have to finish this report first.": "871e5847643e.mp3", "airy|The lunch menu.": "d12eb910ec92.mp3", "airy|Yes, the team won.": "abd4ca924784.mp3", "buttery|How much does it cost to ship this package?": "ca25cf4ee281.mp3", "airy|Twelve dollars.": "81b69e075844.mp3", "airy|By express mail.": "ab52442a209a.mp3", "airy|Within three days.": "ffe3ed19e23f.mp3", "buttery|Let's review the sales figures before the meeting.": "3647a873dcb2.mp3", "airy|Good idea, I'll bring the report.": "edb63d6c8196.mp3", "airy|The figures were high.": "25d872215677.mp3", "airy|In the meeting room.": "19860e48a576.mp3", "airy|Hi, I'm calling to ask whether you have any rooms available for the night of June twelfth.": "74e96b43f369.mp3", "rounded|Let me check. Yes, we have a single room and a suite available.": "88b7999ff79a.mp3", "airy|I'll take the single room. Does the price include breakfast?": "bdca5de3b099.mp3", "rounded|It does. Breakfast is served in the lobby café from six to ten.": "1d3c6b6486df.mp3", "rounded|Linda, the printer on our floor is out of toner again.": "1b50882d3946.mp3", "airy|I ordered more yesterday. It should arrive this afternoon.": "3ac0119bab54.mp3", "rounded|But I need to print the handouts for the two o'clock meeting.": "adcde0fe3493.mp3", "airy|You can use the printer in the marketing department on the third floor.": "3f259f7940e1.mp3", "airy|Excuse me, I'm looking for a gift for my father. He really enjoys cooking.": "d2cceccf3ba8.mp3", "rounded|Our new Italian cookbook is very popular. It came out last week.": "9ca61689afa9.mp3", "airy|That sounds perfect. Could you wrap it for me?": "bf9a2398028b.mp3", "rounded|Certainly. Gift wrapping is free for purchases over twenty dollars.": "27454a92d84b.mp3", "rounded|Have you seen the results of the customer survey?": "10327ab1162b.mp3", "airy|Yes. Most customers like our products, but many said our delivery times are too long.": "724d6c19e5be.mp3", "rounded|Maybe we should work with a second shipping company.": "7781535e7c73.mp3", "airy|Good idea. I'll get some price quotes and present them at Friday's meeting.": "4a8e800daa82.mp3", "airy|Hello, this is Maria from Doctor Lee's office. I'm calling to reschedule your appointment on Thursday.": "e8587cd79faf.mp3", "rounded|Oh, is something wrong?": "76d123965239.mp3", "airy|Doctor Lee has to attend a conference that day. Could you come in on Friday at nine instead?": "2a789599482c.mp3", "rounded|Friday morning is fine. Thanks for letting me know.": "ba145df441cb.mp3", "rounded|Jessica, how's the planning for the company picnic going?": "987900e664e8.mp3", "airy|Pretty well. We've booked Lakeview Park for Saturday, July twentieth.": "26076a257b0a.mp3", "rounded|What happens if it rains?": "78ec2561d1ef.mp3", "airy|The park has a large covered pavilion, so we can move everything inside.": "4f944aecb2d1.mp3", "airy|I'd like to open a savings account. What do I need?": "b41e87f4bd0f.mp3", "rounded|Just a photo ID and a minimum deposit of one hundred dollars.": "1f3ad7756660.mp3", "airy|I have my driver's license with me. Is there a monthly fee?": "2b1f04ecf399.mp3", "rounded|No, there's no fee as long as your balance stays above five hundred dollars.": "e4abddd51c72.mp3", "rounded|The new coffee machine in the break room is great, isn't it?": "9c0ef1c1a56d.mp3", "airy|It is, but it's a little complicated. I couldn't figure out how to make a latte.": "cd4e6a4952e4.mp3", "rounded|There's a short instruction guide taped to the side of it.": "c7b8bd5cc3ac.mp3", "airy|Oh, I didn't see that. I'll take a look after lunch.": "021d80194513.mp3", "airy|Mark, the client from Brenton Industries just called. They want to move our meeting to next week.": "cb34e53929dc.mp3", "rounded|That's actually good news. We need more time to finish the design samples.": "68bea1c00762.mp3", "airy|Then I'll suggest Tuesday afternoon.": "f1c802562939.mp3", "rounded|Sounds good. And please book the large conference room.": "4a8365a1a137.mp3", "rounded|Excuse me, does this bus go to the City Museum?": "bfc8ec2e7b1a.mp3", "airy|It does, but it takes about forty minutes. The number eight bus is much faster.": "214ad9dd54c9.mp3", "rounded|Where can I catch the number eight?": "7d42b0af3a01.mp3", "airy|Across the street, in front of the bank.": "3a767af2c657.mp3", "airy|I heard you're leading the new marketing campaign for the summer sale.": "0ea6553f6303.mp3", "rounded|Yes, and I'd like you to design the posters. You did a great job on the last ones.": "b6eb563252b8.mp3", "airy|I'd be happy to. When do you need them?": "7993abb1140f.mp3", "rounded|By the end of next week, so we have time to print them before the sale starts.": "5b904300ec78.mp3", "rounded|Hi, I ordered a laptop from your website, but I received the wrong model.": "f00c387962ac.mp3", "airy|I'm very sorry about that. Can you give me your order number?": "60d9c24d82fa.mp3", "rounded|Sure, it's four, seven, two, nine, one.": "6c098911fb92.mp3", "airy|Thank you. I'll send you a prepaid label so you can return it, and we'll ship the correct model today.": "f95c87f5daa2.mp3", "airy|Robert, are you going to the technology conference in Singapore next month?": "10b4aa8d69d0.mp3", "rounded|I'd like to, but my travel budget hasn't been approved yet.": "9f596988e5fa.mp3", "airy|You should talk to Ms. Patel. She's in charge of approving travel requests now.": "99018b482fbb.mp3", "rounded|Thanks, I'll e-mail her this afternoon.": "a4c8dd894cd9.mp3", "buttery|Hi, this is Karen Wells from Blue Sky Travel. I'm calling about your trip to Rome next month.": "8ae66b661835.mp3", "buttery|Unfortunately, the hotel you requested is fully booked for those dates.": "34eac183ccf5.mp3", "buttery|However, we've found a similar hotel just two blocks away, and it costs about the same.": "990413aa8d87.mp3", "buttery|Please call me back at your earliest convenience so we can confirm the reservation.": "f2abdf5e7f58.mp3", "buttery|Good morning, everyone, and welcome to Fairview Chocolate Factory.": "046f93119d14.mp3", "buttery|During today's tour, you'll see how our chocolates are made, from roasting the cocoa beans to wrapping the final product.": "fb5968e9e152.mp3", "buttery|For safety reasons, please wear the hairnets provided and stay behind the yellow lines.": "ee200e4590a4.mp3", "buttery|At the end of the tour, you'll have a chance to taste some of our newest flavors in the gift shop.": "880892e3ef9a.mp3", "buttery|Is your old refrigerator using too much electricity? Come to Hamilton Appliances this weekend for our annual energy-saving sale.": "8105627cd3ce.mp3", "buttery|All energy-efficient refrigerators and washing machines are thirty percent off.": "5071172e6cf5.mp3", "buttery|Plus, if you bring in your old appliance, we'll take it away for free.": "2000f3a9218e.mp3", "buttery|Hamilton Appliances is located on Grove Street, next to the city library.": "5884e065d86c.mp3", "buttery|Before we end today's meeting, I'd like to remind everyone about the new expense report system.": "a712883af9c2.mp3", "buttery|Starting next month, all expense reports must be submitted online instead of on paper.": "f01273b48538.mp3", "buttery|The finance department will hold two training sessions next week, on Tuesday and Thursday at 3 P.M. Please sign up for one of them by this Friday.": "24744cb43788.mp3", "buttery|Good afternoon, passengers. This is your captain speaking. We are currently flying at an altitude of thirty-five thousand feet, and we expect to arrive in Sydney about twenty minutes ahead of schedule.": "e41ad2dbf80a.mp3", "buttery|The weather in Sydney is sunny, with a temperature of twenty-four degrees.": "ac0a915701a3.mp3", "buttery|In about thirty minutes, our cabin crew will begin serving dinner.": "b05d6577e4ff.mp3", "buttery|Please keep your seat belts fastened while seated.": "f89cd68e0921.mp3", "buttery|In local news, the city council has approved a plan to build a new bicycle lane along Main Street.": "807793cdbe3e.mp3", "buttery|Construction will begin in April and is expected to take about three months.": "d18c91338ccc.mp3", "buttery|During that time, one lane of traffic will be closed during the day.": "692c04f70136.mp3", "buttery|City officials say the project will make cycling safer and help reduce traffic downtown.": "29b22dfe16e3.mp3", "buttery|Attention, Brookside Mall shoppers. The mall will be closing in fifteen minutes.": "5561224d3ab3.mp3", "buttery|Please bring your final purchases to the registers now. We'd also like to remind you that starting tomorrow, the mall will open one hour earlier, at 9 A.M., for the holiday season.": "b3851320bb0e.mp3", "buttery|Thank you for shopping at Brookside Mall, and have a pleasant evening.": "469062611282.mp3", "buttery|Welcome to your first day at Norton Engineering. This morning, you'll complete some paperwork with the human resources team and receive your ID badges.": "ed307ee8f0ab.mp3", "buttery|After lunch, your team leaders will show you around the office and introduce you to your coworkers.": "e1feb8225b48.mp3", "buttery|Tomorrow, you'll begin a two-day training course on our design software.": "552b1a5fc4f4.mp3", "buttery|Thank you for calling the Lakeside Art Museum. We are open Tuesday through Sunday from 10 A.M. to 6 P.M., and on Thursdays until 9 P.M. Admission is free for children under twelve.": "7d77cfd64bc0.mp3", "buttery|Our special exhibition of modern Japanese prints runs until the end of May.": "17e3ffd39fcb.mp3", "buttery|To hear about guided tours, press one. To speak with a staff member, please stay on the line.": "797b3ba4ceb6.mp3", "buttery|Good evening, and thank you for coming to tonight's workshop on personal finance.": "5dd01cad5a67.mp3", "buttery|Our speaker, Daniel Park, is a financial advisor with over fifteen years of experience.": "808bb274866b.mp3", "buttery|He'll be sharing simple tips on how to save money and plan for the future.": "7fb33fde0325.mp3", "buttery|At the end of his talk, there will be time for questions, so please write them on the cards on your tables.": "5255d4506caa.mp3", "glassy|He's chopping vegetables.": "8a71843e21fb.mp3", "glassy|He's washing some dishes.": "5f1bcac94b3d.mp3", "glassy|He's taking off his hat.": "38b318ea8013.mp3", "glassy|He's opening an oven.": "c28adc006717.mp3", "glassy|They're looking at some plans.": "d6e92bbcb6f6.mp3", "glassy|They're climbing a ladder.": "a7f50073ac2c.mp3", "glassy|They're putting on their helmets.": "bb1b8a325d36.mp3", "glassy|They're carrying some bricks.": "99782c7ea09d.mp3"}